## Case: assembly-namespace-package
id: "av.parity.1091.assembly-namespace-package"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1091"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
#in sys {
    if current == Windows {
        use auto.math.answer
    }
    if current != Windows {
        use auto.math.answer
    }
}
fn main() int { return #{ answer(40) } }
```

#### math.at

```auto
pub fn answer(a int) int { return a + 2 }
```

